%%body
{
  Lowering your weapons, you watch the Elemental howl at the sky with its body broke apart.

  Once the ambient sound of the world returned, you sigh.

    @ Nori "It'll be back."

  Oh great.

    @ Nori "That aside, its death is not without consequence, or benefit depending on how you view it, wood seems to transform in the presence of mana... corrupted mana."

  Corrupted mana?

    @ Nori "Yes, you may not be aware but mana accumulates within the world, if not cycled or used it can become stagnant... or corrupt."

  That sounds concerning.

    @ Nori "It's not as bad as I make it out to, it's more harmful to life within the world, the world tree... doesn't care."

  Nori, that is concerning.

    @ Nori "I promise you, it should not affect you directly at this point, keep an eye on your machines however."

  You sigh and shake your head at Nori's nonchalant dismissal of your concern.

}
%date 2026-08-15
